| 5 | AT THE MERGE | the first use of the carried house: real work driven from the MCP seat and the CLI, the road's items read by filter, every surprise filed as a red. IN USE: the sessions of 2026-11-17 and 2026-11-18 worked from the carried house through the MCP seat and the CLI (the daemon wiki's decisions, research and both backlogs), and the heal list took what they met; so did the sessions of 2026-11-19 (two controllers, the re-stand by `rebuild`, card A and card B); the road's items now read by filter (PR #268) and whole as `road.html` (PR #280); backlog-alpha #/next raises its close with the operator | Dogfooding turns the carry into wave two's evidence. |

